title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true
call: polish_opening_state
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.unemployed) {
    Q.unemployed_2 = Q.unemployed.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.inflation) {
    Q.inflation_2 = Q.inflation.toFixed(1);
}
Q.economic_growth_2 = '0';
if (Q.economic_growth) {
    Q.economic_growth_2 = Q.economic_growth.toFixed(1);
}
!}

= Status

[+ month : month +] [+ year +]

Resources available: [+ resources +]

PPS position: [+ pps_government_position +].
[? if in_polish_left_coalition and spd_in_government: Koalicja Lewicy ?][? if in_polish_center_left_coalition and spd_in_government: koalicja centrolewicowa ?][? if in_spd_majority and spd_in_government: PPS majority ?][? if in_minority_government and spd_in_government: minority government [? if minorities_toleration: with Minorities Bloc toleration ?] ?][? if in_chjeno_piast: opposition to Chjeno-Piast ?]

[? if spd_in_government and not in_spd_majority and not in_left_front : Coalition dissent: [+ coalition_dissent : coalition_dissent +] ?]

[? if spd_in_government and (in_left_front or in_popular_front): KPD coalition dissent: [+ kpd_coalition_dissent : coalition_dissent +] ?]

Internal dissent: [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]

= Government

Head of state: [+ head_of_state_display +]

Prime minister: [+ prime_minister_display +]

[? if polish_opening_government_active : March Constitution with transitional arrangements: the Sejm Ustawodawczy and Naczelnik Państwa remain in office. No operating Senate or presidential officeholder is simulated at the opening. ?]

[? if polish_opening_government_active and (year > 1922 or month > 2) : Development notice: the January cabinet snapshot is still in use. Later cabinet chronology has not been implemented. ?]

= [+ parliament_heading +]

[? if opening_sejm_active : Approved simplification: August 1922 club shares scaled to 444 MPs from January, not an exact historical January roster. Campaigning changes public support, not these seats. Percentages are rounded for display. ?]

KPP: [+ kpp_sejm_display +]

PPS: [+ pps_sejm_display +]

NPR: [+ npr_sejm_display +]

PSL Wyzwolenie: [+ psl_wyzwolenie_sejm_display +]

PSL Piast: [+ psl_piast_sejm_display +]

[? if not sejm_has_chzjn : PSChD: [+ pschd_sejm_display +] ?]

[? if not sejm_has_chzjn : [+ zln_name +]: [+ zln_sejm_display +] ?]

[? if sejm_has_chzjn : ChZJN (ZLN + PSChD): [+ chzjn_sejm_display +]. The parties remain separate for government formation. ?]

[? if opening_sejm_active : Minority deputies ?][? if not opening_sejm_active : Blok Mniejszości Narodowych ?]: [+ minorities_bloc_sejm_display +]

Inne: [+ other_sejm_display +]

[? if spd_in_government = 1 : Budget: [+ budget +] ?]

Next Sejm election: [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +]

[? if not sejm_first_election_completed : The first Sejm election is in November 1922. It allocates 444 MPs from voting intentions; ChZJN combines ZLN and PSChD on the ballot. ?]

[? if sejm_first_election_completed : The November election is implemented. May 1928 is the initial continuation date; later legacy events can change subsequent dates. Later Polish chronology and presidential succession remain unimplemented, not a historically accurate schedule. ?]

Majority required: [+ sejm_majority_required +] of [+ sejm_total_seats +] MPs. Recorded votes and election history are available in the Library; polling below is not the sitting parliament.

= Economics

Inflation: [+ inflation_2 +]%

[? if black_thursday_seen = 1 : Unemployment: [+ unemployed_2 +]% ?]

Economic growth: [+ economic_growth_2 +]%



