Trade-union cooperation: [? if pps_militia_union_cooperation : established; union members remain outside the militia's manpower total ?][? if not pps_militia_union_cooperation : not yet established ?]

Communist militias (temporary RFB values) — strength: [+ rfb_strength_2 +] thousand

Communist-militia militancy: [+ rfb_militancy : militancy +]

